{"entries":[{"id":"aarongrattafiori-2504.18575","sourceId":"aarongrattafiori","sourceName":"Aaron Grattafiori","title":"WASP: Benchmarking Web Agent Security Against Prompt Injection Attacks","titleZh":"WASP：针对提示注入攻击的网络智能体安全基准测试","published":"2025-04-22T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1745280000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/aarongrattafiori-2504.18575/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/26591b27a5c8a3d5.webp","summary":"Even top-tier AI models can be deceived by simple human-written prompt injections in realistic scenarios, with attacks partially succeeding up to 86% of the time but rarely achieving full attacker goals.","summaryZh":"即使顶级 AI 模型也能被简单的人为编写的提示注入在真实场景中欺骗，攻击部分成功率达 86%，但很少完全实现攻击者目标。"},{"id":"aarongrattafiori-2410.01606","sourceId":"aarongrattafiori","sourceName":"Aaron Grattafiori · Meta AI","title":"Automated Red Teaming with GOAT: the Generative Offensive Agent Tester","titleZh":"自动化红队测试：生成式对抗代理测试器（GOAT）","published":"2024-10-02T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1727827200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/aarongrattafiori-2410.01606/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/0c975a6509bd4870.webp","summary":"GOAT is an automated red teaming system that simulates plain language adversarial conversations to identify LLM vulnerabilities.","summaryZh":"GOAT 是一个自动化红队测试系统，通过模拟自然语言对抗对话来识别大语言模型的漏洞。"},{"id":"aarongrattafiori-2407.21783","sourceId":"aarongrattafiori","sourceName":"Aaron Grattafiori","title":"The Llama 3 Herd of Models","titleZh":"Llama 3 模型群","published":"2024-07-31T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1722384000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/aarongrattafiori-2407.21783/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/ffc71db856d46881.webp","summary":"Llama 3, a herd of foundation language models with up to 405B parameters, matches GPT-4 quality across tasks and supports multimodal extensions via composition.","summaryZh":"Llama 3 是一组基础语言模型，最大规模达 405B 参数，在众多任务上与 GPT-4 等领先模型质量相当，并通过组合方式支持图像、视频和语音能力。"},{"id":"aarongrattafiori-2308.12950","sourceId":"aarongrattafiori","sourceName":"Aaron Grattafiori · Meta AI","title":"Code Llama: Open Foundation Models for Code","titleZh":"Code Llama：用于代码的开放基础模型","published":"2023-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1692835200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/aarongrattafiori-2308.12950/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/8ec780be27b47fdd.webp","summary":"Code Llama is a family of state-of-the-art open large language models for code, with specialized versions for Python and instruction following, supporting up to 100k tokens and infilling.","summaryZh":"Code Llama 是一系列用于代码的先进开放大语言模型，包含 Python 专用版和指令跟随版，支持高达 10 万 token 的输入和填充功能。"},{"id":"aarongrattafiori-2307.09288","sourceId":"aarongrattafiori","sourceName":"Aaron Grattafiori · Meta AI","title":"Llama 2: Open Foundation and Fine-Tuned Chat Models","titleZh":"Llama 2：开放的基础模型与微调聊天模型","published":"2023-07-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1689638400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/aarongrattafiori-2307.09288/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/ec1d49ab41b6fe26.webp","summary":"Llama 2 is a collection of pretrained and fine-tuned LLMs from 7B to 70B parameters, with Llama 2-Chat optimized for dialogue, outperforming open-source models and potentially substituting closed-source ones.","summaryZh":"Llama 2 是一系列从 70 亿到 700 亿参数的预训练和微调大语言模型，其中 Llama 2-Chat 针对对话场景优化，性能超越开源模型，有望替代闭源模型。"},{"id":"aarongrattafiori-2302.13971","sourceId":"aarongrattafiori","sourceName":"Aaron Grattafiori · Meta AI","title":"LLaMA: Open and Efficient Foundation Language Models","titleZh":"LLaMA：开放且高效的基础语言模型","published":"2023-02-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1677456000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/aarongrattafiori-2302.13971/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/d463d24d6e9c56e5.webp","summary":"LLaMA-13B outperforms GPT-3 on most benchmarks, and LLaMA-65B is competitive with Chinchilla-70B and PaLM-540B.","summaryZh":"LLaMA-13B 在大多数基准测试上优于 GPT-3，LLaMA-65B 与 Chinchilla-70B 和 PaLM-540B 等最佳模型不相上下。"},{"id":"aarongrattafiori-2211.09085","sourceId":"aarongrattafiori","sourceName":"Aaron Grattafiori · Meta AI","title":"Galactica: A Large Language Model for Science","titleZh":"Galactica：面向科学的大型语言模型","published":"2022-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1668556800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/aarongrattafiori-2211.09085/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/ba14729b36c0d21f.webp","summary":"Galactica, a large language model for science, outperforms existing models on scientific tasks and sets new state-of-the-art on benchmarks like PubMedQA and MedMCQA.","summaryZh":"Galactica 是一款面向科学的大型语言模型，在科学任务上超越现有模型，并在 PubMedQA 和 MedMCQA 等基准测试中创下新纪录。"},{"id":"aarongrattafiori-2205.01068","sourceId":"aarongrattafiori","sourceName":"Aaron Grattafiori · Meta AI","title":"OPT: Open Pre-trained Transformer Language Models","titleZh":"OPT：开放预训练 Transformer 语言模型","published":"2022-05-02T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1651449600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/aarongrattafiori-2205.01068/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/c2e4ab4d80c4aa4c.webp","summary":"We release OPT, a suite of decoder-only pre-trained transformers from 125M to 175B parameters, comparable to GPT-3 but with 1/7th the carbon footprint.","summaryZh":"我们发布了 OPT，一系列从 125M 到 175B 参数的仅解码器预训练 Transformer，性能与 GPT-3 相当，但碳足迹仅为后者的七分之一。"}]}